[00:01.097]铁花飞
[00:03.130]A frozen breath
[00:06.434]A calloused hand
[00:09.701]Walking through a peaceful neighborhood
[00:16.584]Isn't it beautiful?
[00:19.701]Such a beautiful
[00:23.535]Such a beautiful vibrancy
[00:29.880]I am alright
[00:33.063]I am content
[00:36.248]Looking through an old kaleidoscope
[00:43.180]Isn't it laughable?
[00:47.030]The pain we held close
[00:50.197]Dissolves into smoke readily
[00:56.462]As I'm finally on the receiving side of misfortune
[01:02.964]I can see your reasons
[01:06.380]And your clingy demons
[01:09.597]Like a rotten mandarin
[01:12.763]Inside, we had good intentions
[01:16.296]I may be still unripened
[01:19.729]But I'm not afraid
[01:22.563]在这一刻，我的心平静如水
[01:30.129]没有谁能迫我退悔
[01:36.163]四面楚歌，这颗心无惧无畏
[01:43.364]铁花飞，飘逸不残灰
[01:50.846]千年之后还剩下什么？
[01:54.297]灵魂的重量又怎能取舍
[01:57.446]有共存才有未来可说
[02:00.829]不一定牵着手
[02:01.963]但一定永远向前走
[02:04.097]正确了又能证明什么？
[02:07.263]就算能从过去找出差错
[02:10.746]身世境遇不由人选择
[02:14.179]有理解就足够
[02:15.463]盼日夜细水长流
[02:21.296]Let our memories unite
[02:24.496]Then maybe we'll see a new sight
[02:28.929]Yes we're both right
[02:30.829]I know we're both right
[02:33.497]In the tiny birdcage we divide
[02:38.096]Seeing the world with my own eyes
[02:39.994]And for a minute I was embarrassed by my short insight
[02:43.130]All this time I was so focused on myself
[02:46.563]Making sure this strongest strongest woman was all they saw
[02:50.146]Right?
[02:51.079]小时候只是服从
[02:52.379]成长过程中开始疑问
[02:54.026]为什么你不再是我印象中那样完美无缺？
[02:57.347]长大后终于理解
[02:58.700]逞强也是一种爱的表现
[03:00.499]呵，原谅你，也原谅我自己
[03:02.685]在这一刻，我的心平静如水
[03:10.102]没有谁能迫我退悔
[03:16.151]四面楚歌，这颗心无惧无畏
[03:23.318]铁花飞，飘逸不残灰
